#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibanga bw'ibyangombwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Dosiye y'urufunguzo rw'ububiko bw'ibanga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye igana ku rufunguzo rwa bayiti 32 rushyira mu ibanga ibyangombwa byo kwinjira byabitswe. Yiremere ubwawe, hanze y'umuzi w'urubuga, isomwa gusa na seriveri y'urubuga n'ukoresha wa poller, mu bubiko bw'amadosiye aho root n'uwo ukoresha bonyine bashobora kwandika (ni na ko bimeze ku madosiye y'ibyangombwa); umugereka ntushobora na rimwe kuyirema cyangwa kuyandika. Yibikeho kopi hamwe n'ububiko bw'amakuru: itariho, ibyangombwa byo kwinjira byabitswe bigomba kongera kwinjizwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amadosiye y'ibyangombwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye igana ku bubiko bw'amadosiye bubitse amadosiye y'ibyangombwa byo kwinjira. Konti ishobora gusoma ibyangombwa byayo mu dosiye iri imbere yabwo gusa, ntabwo ari muri dosiye y'urufunguzo rw'ububiko bw'ibanga. Ubusa, ari bwo busanzwe, buhakana amadosiye y'ibyangombwa. Umuyobozi wa Cloud ahitamo dosiye, bityo ubike hano gusa ibyangombwa bya Cloud."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Igikusanyamakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Igihe cyagenewe igikusanyamakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Amasegonda igikorwa kimwe cy'igikusanyamakuru gishobora kumara mbere y'uko gihagarika gutangira akazi gashya. Bigumishe munsi y'intera ya poller; konti zitarangije zikomeza mu gikorwa gikurikira."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Iyo byemejwe, gukura umugereka muri sisitemu bigumishaho konti zawo, ibyangombwa byo kwinjira byashyizwe mu ibanga, n'ububiko bw'agateganyo. Kuraho ikimenyetso kugira ngo gukura muri sisitemu bibisibe. Ibikorwaremezo bya Cloud ntibikorwaho na rimwe mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Ntibiragenzurwa."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Ibyangombwa byo kwinjira birakora kandi bifite uburenganzira iyi konti ikeneye."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Utanga serivisi yanze ibyangombwa byo kwinjira. Bishobora kuba bitari byo, byararangiye, cyangwa byarambuwe agaciro."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Ibyangombwa byo kwinjira birakora ariko bibura uburenganzira iyi konti ikeneye."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Utanga serivisi ntiyashoboye kugerwaho. Genzura inzira y'umuyoboro n'amategeko y'ibisohoka kuri poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Utanga serivisi aragabanya umuvuduko w'ubusabe. Ongera ugerageze nyuma."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Utanga serivisi yohereje igisubizo umugereka utashoboye gusoma."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Konti cyangwa ibyangombwa byayo byo kwinjira ntibyagenwe neza."

